  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Waterproof</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ High Shine Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A high-performance, long-wearing lip lacquer that combines shine with transfer-proof color for an irresistible glossy lip that lasts up to eight hours.</p><p> <strong><br>Finish: </strong>High Shine</p><p><strong><br>Skin Type: </strong>Normal, Oily, Dry, Combination</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Marine Algae Extract: Smooths and nourishes lips.</p><p>- Shine Boost: Provides high shine and adherence.</p><p>- Flexible Film Forming Polymers: For a breathable, weightless feel.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> Free of parabens, formaldehydes, formaldehyde-releasing agents, phthalates, mineral oil, retinyl palmitate, oxybenzone, coal tar, hydroquinone, sulfates SLS & SLES, tricl</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:<br></strong>-Shake well.</p><p>-Apply a thin layer to parted lips and keep lips apart for 15 seconds to set.</p><p>-Shine all day.</p><p><br></p><p>To remove:</p><p>-Use an oil-based makeup cleanser.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Marine Algae Extract: Marine Algae Extract: Smooths and nourishes lips.<br>-Shine Boost: Provides high shine and adherence.<br>-Flexible Film Forming Polymers: For a breathable, weightless feel.<br><br>Isododecane, Diphenyl Dimethicone, Trioctyldodecyl Citrate, Polyurethane-1, Disiloxane, Di-C12-13 Alkyl Tartrate, Bis-Hydroxyethoxypropyl Dimethicone/IPDI Copolymer Ethylcarbamate, Alcohol, Dipentaerythrityl Pentaisononanoate, Sodium Hyaluronate, Undaria Pinnatifida Extract, Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Glucomannan, Trihydroxystearin, Dicalcium Phosphate, CI 15850 (Red 7 Lake), CI 42090 (Blue 1 Lake), CI 77491/77492 (Iron Oxides), CI 19140 (Yellow 5 Lake), CI 15850 (Red 6), CI 77891 (Titanium Dioxide).</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Waterproof</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ High Shine Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A high-performance, long-wearing lip lacquer that combines shine with transfer-proof color for an irresistible glossy lip that lasts up to eight hours.</p><p> <strong><br>Finish: </strong>High Shine</p><p><strong><br>Skin Type: </strong>Normal, Oily, Dry, Combination</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Marine Algae Extract: Smooths and nourishes lips.</p><p>- Shine Boost: Provides high shine and adherence.</p><p>- Flexible Film Forming Polymers: For a breathable, weightless feel.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> Free of parabens, formaldehydes, formaldehyde-releasing agents, phthalates, mineral oil, retinyl palmitate, oxybenzone, coal tar, hydroquinone, sulfates SLS & SLES, tricl</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:<br></strong>-Shake well.</p><p>-Apply a thin layer to parted lips and keep lips apart for 15 seconds to set.</p><p>-Shine all day.</p><p><br></p><p>To remove:</p><p>-Use an oil-based makeup cleanser.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Marine Algae Extract: Marine Algae Extract: Smooths and nourishes lips.<br>-Shine Boost: Provides high shine and adherence.<br>-Flexible Film Forming Polymers: For a breathable, weightless feel.<br><br>Isododecane, Diphenyl Dimethicone, Trioctyldodecyl Citrate, Polyurethane-1, Disiloxane, Di-C12-13 Alkyl Tartrate, Bis-Hydroxyethoxypropyl Dimethicone/IPDI Copolymer Ethylcarbamate, Alcohol, Dipentaerythrityl Pentaisononanoate, Sodium Hyaluronate, Undaria Pinnatifida Extract, Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Glucomannan, Trihydroxystearin, Dicalcium Phosphate, CI 15850 (Red 7 Lake), CI 42090 (Blue 1 Lake), CI 77491/77492 (Iron Oxides), CI 19140 (Yellow 5 Lake), CI 15850 (Red 6), CI 77891 (Titanium Dioxide).</div></details>",
